waitpid: preserve absolute timeouts without timerfd on wasm

Use an absolute CLOCK_MONOTONIC deadline through epoll_wait where timerfd is
unavailable. Long waits are split into capped slices and recomputed after every
wake; when a PID and the deadline become ready together, preserve the existing
readiness-first policy.

--- a/misc-utils/waitpid.c
+++ b/misc-utils/waitpid.c
@@ -18,7 +18,9 @@
  */
 
